%% Figure 24.14 — The adversary keeps the protocol undecided
flowchart LR
  B0["Bivalent state<br/>0 or 1 still possible"] -->|"deliver harmless message"| B1["Still bivalent"]
  B1 -->|"critical message pending"| Q{"Slow or crashed?"}
